    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This report examines the growing phenomenon of temporary work, its extent and character in Silicon Valley, and the issues which arise from the patterns of temporary employment in Santa Clara County. It analyzes a new survey of temporary employees at Stanford University and Hospitals and offers recommendations for employers to ensure that temporary work conforms to basic community standards",
